{{LangSwitch}} {{Navbar modding}} {{Page version|42.13.1|2=985323}} {{Removed|Build 42.13.0|ItemType}} he '''{{Code|Type}}''' parameter defines the class the item will be instantiated as. All items are created as an {{JavaObject|InventoryItem|package=zombie/inventory|customDoc=https://demiurgequantified.github.io/ProjectZomboidJavaDocs/}}'s subclass, based on the value of this parameter. The various parameters the [[item (scripts)|item script]] can have are dependent on the class of the item; such as food items will hold nutritional values and weapon items will hold damage values.
The possible values are: * AlarmClock * AlarmClockClothing * Animal * Clothing * Container * Drainable * Food * Key * Literature * Map * Moveable * Normal * Radio * Weapon * WeaponPart
Below is an example for the parameter: {{CodeSnip| code = Type = Food, }}
